UC6 ..> UC7 : <<include>>
UC7 ..> UC8 : <<include>>

Instructor --> UC9
UC9 ..> UC10 : <<include>>
UC10 ..> UC4 : <<include>>
UC10 ..> UC11 : <<include>>
UC11 ..> UC12 : <<include>>
UC12 ..> UC13 : <<include>>
